{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-032",
    "title": "：失去名字的人"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_174",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "顾长离走上来，把铜环递给他：“它刚才在发热。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "天门第一声鸣响后，回川城的雪停了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5657,
          "end": 5657
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "停下的不是雪，而是所有人的时间。街边飘落的雪花悬在半空，火盆里的灰烬凝成灰白色的线，连陆照临眼角滑下的泪也停在半途。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5659,
          "end": 5659
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "只有天门仍在开启。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5661,
          "end": 5661
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离已经冲下街道。她的债契黑纹虽然被铜针截断，颈侧仍留着一圈深色印记。她用铜针挑断树根，将被困的孩子交给家人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5683,
          "end": 5683
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "可那名父亲看见孩子后，忽然哭喊：“这不是我的女儿！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5685,
          "end": 5685
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "孩子抬头：“爹，我记得你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5687,
          "end": 5687
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不记得你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5689,
          "end": 5689
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离一掌击在父亲胸口，逼他后退：“记忆不一致，不代表人是假的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5691,
          "end": 5691
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "父亲仍在摇头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5693,
          "end": 5693
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临跑到街心，将无名小灯放在地面。小灯没有火，却释放出一圈稳定的白光。白光经过的人，记忆冲突暂时减弱。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5695,
          "end": 5695
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“范围太小。”叶观澜从钟楼跃下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5697,
          "end": 5697
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把灯带到城门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5699,
          "end": 5699
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城门正在塌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5701,
          "end": 5701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就先撑住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5703,
          "end": 5703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拔刀斩向裂缝。刀光化作黑色弧线，暂时封住城墙上的缺口。灵气倒灌却越来越强，黑色弧线表面迅速结霜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5705,
          "end": 5705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻站在钟楼下，敲响无相铜镜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5707,
          "end": 5707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜声传遍回川城，居民的名字牌重新浮出。可每一块牌子上同时出现两个名字，一个属于现在，一个属于三百年前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5709,
          "end": 5709
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们开始重叠。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5711,
          "end": 5711
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“能分开吗？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5713,
          "end": 5713
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只能让他们选择保留哪一个。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5715,
          "end": 5715
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果他们都不想失去？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5717,
          "end": 5717
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就会被天门一起带走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5719,
          "end": 5719
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中心传来哭喊。昨夜抱着孩子的妇人站在广场，身旁多了一个与她相貌相同的女人。两个女人同时说：“我是她。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5721,
          "end": 5721
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向无相铜镜。镜中显示，两人的记忆都完整，却来自不同年代。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5723,
          "end": 5723
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天门把过去的人带回来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5725,
          "end": 5725
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是带回。”慧闻说，“是把过去的影子放进现在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5727,
          "end": 5727
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第二声天门鸣响在此时落下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5729,
          "end": 5729
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天空黑暗中，一盏盏灯开始下降。每盏灯落地，便有一段旧城景象覆盖现实。街道变成三百年前的石路，房屋变成已经不存在的楼阁，居民被迫站进陌生的过去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5731,
          "end": 5731
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站在两条重叠的街道之间。她看见一个年轻男人从旧城门走来，正是她叔父的模样。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5733,
          "end": 5733
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把灯给我。”男人说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5735,
          "end": 5735
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5737,
          "end": 5737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我是他被留下的部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5739,
          "end": 5739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还记得自己的名字吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5741,
          "end": 5741
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5743,
          "end": 5743
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离将铜针抵在他胸口：“说出来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5745,
          "end": 5745
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾……长……”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5747,
          "end": 5747
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一个字没有出现。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5749,
          "end": 5749
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "债契黑纹从顾长离颈侧重新生长，向那道影子缠去。影子没有躲，任由黑纹穿过身体。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5751,
          "end": 5751
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你的名字缺一笔。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5753,
          "end": 5753
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以我回来找你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5755,
          "end": 5755
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她抬起铜针，却迟迟没有刺下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5757,
          "end": 5757
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无名小灯递给她：“先让他停下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5759,
          "end": 5759
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯会吸走他的影子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5761,
          "end": 5761
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不吸，他会被天门带走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5763,
          "end": 5763
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离接过小灯。白光照在年轻男人身上，他的脸开始变得清晰，最后却定格成一张没有五官的面孔。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5765,
          "end": 5765
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得你。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5767,
          "end": 5767
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "无脸影子向她伸出手：“那就替我记住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5769,
          "end": 5769
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "白光骤然扩大，影子化作一枚铜环，落入顾长离掌心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5771,
          "end": 5771
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的债契黑纹随即向心口收缩，像被重新锁住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5773,
          "end": 5773
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你把他的名字带回来了。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5775,
          "end": 5775
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只带回了铜环。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5777,
          "end": 5777
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字还在门里。”慧闻提醒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5779,
          "end": 5779
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处天门黑暗中，第三盏灯缓缓升高。灯火照出一道熟悉的身影：陆沉舟站在门槛另一侧，手里提着空灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5781,
          "end": 5781
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三声天门鸣响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5793,
          "end": 5793
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他站在钟楼顶端，手里的白灯已经熄灭。掌心残印留下的空白扩大到手腕，金色裂纹则沿气海向上蔓延。刚才失去出生地的痛苦还没有退去，他却清楚记得父亲的名字、声音和那件灰色旧斗篷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5852,
          "end": 5852
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟。”他朝天门喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5854,
          "end": 5854
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内人影停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5856,
          "end": 5856
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还记得我？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5858,
          "end": 5858
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5860,
          "end": 5860
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就别叫我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5862,
          "end": 5862
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5864,
          "end": 5864
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字会让门找到你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5866,
          "end": 5866
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向脚下。回川城的姓名牌重新出现，却没有一块写着“陆沉舟”。所有牌子都只剩姓氏，唯独一块空白牌子在钟楼边缘轻轻摇晃。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5868,
          "end": 5868
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走上来，把铜环递给他：“它刚才在发热。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5870,
          "end": 5870
        }
      }
    ],
